  "estimatedMinutes": 20,
  "instructions": "## A road graph\n\nThe graph joins seven Volta Region towns by road. Neighbours are always taken in **alphabetical order**. Breadth-first search explores town by town in rings around the start, using a queue; depth-first search follows one road as far as it goes, using a stack (the recursion).\n\n## Do this\n\n1. Starting at **Ho**, write the order in which BFS visits the towns, then the order for DFS.\n2. In BFS, how many roads away from Ho is Aflao?\n3. Choose a different **start** town from which BFS reaches Aflao in exactly one step (the `depth:Aflao` metric must be 1), and leave it selected.",
